flowchart TD
  A([Staff member opens Northdesk]) --> B[Ticket list page]
  B --> C[Click New Ticket]
  C --> D[Create ticket form]
  D --> E[Fill in title, description, requester, category, priority]
  E --> F[Click Submit]
  F --> G{Inputs valid?}
  G -- No --> H[Inline error messages shown]
  H --> E
  G -- Yes --> I[Save ticket to Supabase]
  I --> J{Saved OK?}
  J -- No --> K[Error toast shown, form data kept]
  K --> F
  J -- Yes --> L[Success toast shown]
  L --> M[Redirect to ticket list with new ticket]
  M --> N([End])
